<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Getting to Know Me', active: 'home' }) %>

<article class="blog">
  <header class="blog-header">
    <h1>Getting to Know Me</h1>
    <p class="blog-lead">Hello! Welcome to my little corner of the internet!</p>
  </header>

  <p class="blog-opening">I'm a college student currently taking up Bachelor of Science in Computer Science (BSCS). I'm someone who enjoys learning, exploring new ideas, and discovering how things work. I have always been curious about technology, especially how computers, software, and applications are created.</p>

  <section class="blog-section">
    <h2>My Journey</h2>
    <p>My journey in Computer Science has been an interesting experience. Along the way, I've learned different programming concepts, explored various technologies, and faced challenges that helped me become a better learner.</p>
    <p>I'm still in the process of discovering what I'm truly capable of, but I enjoy every opportunity to improve myself. Whether it's writing my first lines of code, fixing errors, or building small projects, I see every experience as a step toward something bigger.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-section">
    <h2>My Interests and Hobbies</h2>
    <p>I have a strong interest in technology and everything related to computers. Some of the things I enjoy exploring include:</p>
    <ul class="blog-list">
      <li><strong>Programming:</strong> Learning different programming languages and understanding how software works.</li>
      <li><strong>Web Development:</strong> Creating websites and experimenting with different designs and functionalities.</li>
      <li><strong>Game Development:</strong> Exploring how games are designed, developed, and brought to life.</li>
      <li><strong>Technology:</strong> Keeping myself curious about new innovations, tools, and digital trends.</li>
      <li><strong>Personal Growth:</strong> Learning new skills, challenging myself, and becoming a better version of myself.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Aside from technology, I also enjoy spending time discovering new hobbies and trying things that allow me to grow as a person.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-section">
    <h2>My Goals and Dreams</h2>
    <p>One of my biggest goals is to become someone who is skilled, independent, and capable of creating something meaningful through technology.</p>
    <p>I want to continue improving my programming skills, work on bigger projects, gain real-world experience, and eventually build something of my own.</p>
    <p>I also believe that success isn't just about having a good career or earning money. It's about having the freedom to make decisions, supporting the people who matter, enjoying life, and being proud of the person I become.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-section">
    <h2>A Little Philosophy</h2>
    <p>I believe that everyone starts somewhere, and nobody becomes successful overnight.</p>
    <p>There are still countless things I don't know, skills I haven't learned, and experiences I haven't encountered. Instead of seeing that as a weakness, I see it as an opportunity.</p>
    <p>I don't expect to have everything figured out right now. I just want to keep moving forward, stay curious, and make the most out of every opportunity that comes my way.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="blog-section">
    <h2>Welcome to My Blog!</h2>
    <p>This website is more than just a personal webpage. It's a place where I can share my thoughts, experiences, interests, and discoveries.</p>
    <p>You might find posts about technology, programming, personal experiences, things I'm learning, or simply random thoughts I want to share.</p>
    <p>Thank you for taking the time to visit. I hope you enjoy exploring my website and getting to know a little more about me!</p>
  </section>

  <p class="blog-closing">Keep learning, keep exploring, and keep moving forward.</p>
  <p class="blog-note">There is also an <a href="/board">open board</a> on this site if you want to leave a post or comment.</p>
</article>

